%% title: Document Lifecycle
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> GENERATED : POST /render (template PUBLISHED, bytes stored, sha256 computed)

    GENERATED --> PENDING_SIGNATURE : signature ceremony opened over the document
    PENDING_SIGNATURE --> SIGNED : ceremony COMPLETED (all signers SIGNED, PAdES-sealed in phase-2)

    GENERATED --> ARCHIVED : retention / manual archive
    SIGNED --> ARCHIVED : retention (retain_until reached)

    ARCHIVED --> [*]

    note right of PENDING_SIGNATURE
        Ceremony status: DRAFT -> PENDING -> PARTIALLY_SIGNED -> COMPLETED
        (or DECLINED / EXPIRED). Any signer DECLINED -> ceremony DECLINED.
    end note
